      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The sonographic and clinical findings in four patients with silicone-augmented breasts are presented. The ultrasonographic differences between breasts with silicone injections and breasts with silicone prosthesis are emphasized. Breast sonography may play a role in evaluation of silicone-augmented breasts. Awareness of this diagnostic procedure may help in evaluating these patients."},
